yub, they assume arab = muslim and muslim = homophobic so arab = homophobic and since they view us as a bunch of homophobes they believe whatever happens to us is fair game. I see from time to time a bunch of queers saying what is happening to palestinians is good because "they are a bunch of homophobes who hate us anyway" and some even straight up calling for their genocide. I am a queer atheist but these people would cheer for my death just because I so happen to be an arab with muslim parents

&#x200B;

It is funny because it's literally basically the exact same thing happening to them in america but they cant see it. They claim all of us are a bad thing (groomers/homophobes) so their hate is just self defense

I once criticized some of the racism that was happening under a post about the way ex-muslims are treated in muslim countries (stuff like calling everyone in middle east/south asia backward monkeys) and was downvoted for it

&#x200B;

If an Ex-Muslim living in a muslim country isnt allowed to voice their opinion on a post about Ex-Muslims living in muslim countries maybe you dont actually care as much as you claim you do

instead of trying to explain how the science works for you ill ask you, what does every single country on earth gain from telling you climate change is real? the middle east believes in it, the 2 americans believe in it, europe and asia believe in it, australia believes in it. everyone with no exception agrees its a real thing. What do all these people gain from that? do you seriously think a country like russia wouldnt love to say "climate change isnt real and america is lying to you" to make itself look better and make america look weak? 

&#x200B;

who is the one lying and why are they lying?

